# RONDB-1062: scan vs key-op deadlock discovery.
# A locking range scan deadlocked with a key operation must be resolved
# by aborting the KEY OP (the scan survives), promptly (proactive), with
# TransactionDeadlockDetectionTimeout set to 60s (see .cnf).
# ndb_deadlock_scan: scan vs key-op deadlock aborted the key op,
# the scan survived, resolved proactively.
